[{"order":1,"type":"heading","text":"Mentoring Junior Engineers and Growing Technical Talent"},{"order":2,"type":"paragraph","text":"Fostering technical growth within a team is a fundamental responsibility of senior engineering leadership. Effective mentoring bridges the gap between theoretical knowledge and real-world production environments, ensuring scalable team success."},{"order":3,"type":"subheading","text":"Establishing Psychological Safety"},{"order":4,"type":"paragraph","text":"Before technical skills can flourish, junior engineers need an environment where asking questions is encouraged and failure is treated as a learning opportunity. Clear communication channels set the foundation for trust."},{"order":5,"type":"bullet_point","text":"Encourage asking 'why' rather than just 'how'."},{"order":6,"type":"bullet_point","text":"Frame code review comments around the code, never the individual."},{"order":7,"type":"bullet_point","text":"Celebrate milestones, no matter how small."},{"order":8,"type":"subheading","text":"Structured Onboarding and Goal Setting"},{"order":9,"type":"paragraph","text":"Ambiguity causes anxiety for new team members. Utilizing structured frameworks helps define clear expectations over 30, 60, and 90-day intervals."},{"order":10,"type":"code","text":"class MentorshipPlan {
  constructor(public menteeName: string, public targetRole: string) {}

  public assignMilestone(task: string): void {
    console.log(`Assigning milestone: ${task} to ${this.menteeName}`);
  }
}"},{"order":11,"type":"subheading","text":"Actionable Code Reviews"},{"order":12,"type":"paragraph","text":"Code reviews are your primary pedagogical tool. Instead of simply rewriting code for the junior engineer, guide them toward the solution using the Socratic method."},{"order":13,"type":"bullet_point","text":"Ask questions like: 'What happens to this function if the input is null?'"},{"order":14,"type":"bullet_point","text":"Highlight well-written sections to reinforce positive behaviors."},{"order":15,"type":"subheading","text":"Conclusion"},{"order":16,"type":"paragraph","text":"Growing technical talent requires patience, consistency, and empathy. By investing time in mentorship, senior engineers multiply their impact and build resilient, high-performing teams."}]
